  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF WASH Cluster Coordinator Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assignment at the request of UNICEF. Given the multiplicity and importance of the emergencies and in line with the discussions for a potential activation of cluster in the country, UNICEF requests a WASH cluster coordinator for a period of two months to support the national and subnational coordination with a nationwide cholera crisis.</narrative>
